   "text": "Set It Down. It Won't Spill. | Mobile Style™ Breast Pumps M6 | Built To Stay Leak-Free | -295 mmHg, Still Under 50dB | Still Only 4 Parts To Wash | {KeyWord:Momcozy} Official | Quiet Enough For A Meeting | 30 Days To Change Your Mind | Free 1-On-1 IBCLC Session | Yes, You Can Pump At Work | Start With 4 Parts, Not 8 | Save 20% With Code BDBW20 | World Breastfeeding Week | FSA & HSA Eligible | Not Sure Of Your Flange Size? | Never pumped before? It sits in your bra and runs on its own. Hands free. | Rhythm-tested with 1,100+ moms across 17,500 hours of R&D. GREENGUARD Certified. | 600+ patents and 30+ awards. FSA/HSA eligible with free shipping over $25. | Flange fit is based on nipple size, not breast size. Measure with our guide.",
